    {"type":"text","id":"summarytext","x":240,"y":738,"width":880,"height":52,"text":"结论：OpenClaw 自带记忆适合做“规则底座”和显式长期约束。\nOpenViking 更适合做“可召回、可扩展”的长期语义记忆；两者更像分层配合。","originalText":"结论：OpenClaw 自带记忆适合做“规则底座”和显式长期约束。\nOpenViking 更适合做“可召回、可扩展”的长期语义记忆；两者更像分层配合。","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":131,"version":2,"versionNonce":2041,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25}
